        },
        "description": "Explicit before-payment customer contract. Allocation item IDs are quote operation IDs; consume the whole group once. Homologation/model55 only. Review reference is provenance, not proof of accountant approval. No default tax, allocation basis or refund policy. sale_id is the planned checkout/sale identity and must match the server command and frozen invoice snapshot."
